*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : INT0051
*> PURPOSE : INTEREST TIERS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-04-10 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-11-07 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 711
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB INTNIGHT STEP070
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0051.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY INT0051C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> APPLIED INTEREST RATE
    05 WS-IRT             PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM 3000-TERM-RATE
    DISPLAY "WS-IRT=" WS-IRT
    STOP RUN.
3000-TERM-RATE.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> SHORT TERM DEPOSIT RATE - LIMIT 4.5 PER 1998 POLICY
        WHEN D-BAND-1-3
            MOVE 0.0300 TO WS-IRT
        *> MEDIUM TERM DEPOSIT RATE - LIMIT 6 PER 1998 POLICY
        WHEN D-BAND-4-12
            MOVE 0.0375 TO WS-IRT
        *> LONG TERM DEPOSIT RATE - LIMIT 45 PER 1998 POLICY
        WHEN D-TM >= 13 AND <= 60
            MOVE 0.0450 TO WS-IRT
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 0.0150 TO WS-IRT
    END-EVALUATE.
